{"ID":"20240118144956-bxqe4nx","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118144956-bxqe4nx","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118144956-bxqe4nx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118144956-jwb67ou\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122170151-khcndt5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:200,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122170151-khcndt5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:155,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:155\u0026#125;","title":"371补14乳香","type":"doc","updated":"20240204163715"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118144956-jwb67ou","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118144956-jwb67ou","updated":"20240122170112"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产池】产西南热地及西藏等处，为树中流出之脂液，凝结成块者，入药。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170113-ki3ar4l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170113-ki3ar4l"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味苦辛，性微温，无毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170115-z4smyml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170115-z4smyml","updated":"20240122170129"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】乳香为活血伸筋要药，主通行周身经络，去风散瘀，活血定痛[金铃子、延胡索、没药、乳香都有镇痛作用。因为可以活血化瘀。痛是不通则痛。]，托疮毒，消痈疽。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170132-xx3akbi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170132-xx3akbi"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】主风水毒肿，去恶气，伏尸，痈疹痒毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170134-f0h9elp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170134-f0h9elp"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【之才】治不眠。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170135-3m8immb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170135-3m8immb"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【大明】下气，益精，补腰膝，治肾气，止霍乱冲恶，中邪气心腹痛疰气，煎膏止痛长肉。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170138-u43zmyx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170138-u43zmyx"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【元素】补肾，定诸经之痛。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170139-hl8lnqg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170139-hl8lnqg"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通五分至二钱。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170140-mnimvbv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170140-mnimvbv"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】痈疽已溃，不宜服，诸疮脓多时，未宜遽用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170112-0qtyizx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170112-0qtyizx"}},{"ID":"20240122170141-7mu7mhm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170141-7mu7mhm"}},{"ID":"20240122170141-fvxr9l8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170141-fvxr9l8","updated":"20240204163509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第十四乳香，乳香呢是在我国西南的地方啊，西藏啊这个四川一带的地方都有云贵高原一带，也是一样是树里面流出来的汁液，乳香这个很香，烧起来好像松脂的味道，很香啊，味苦辛性温，主治呢，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"乳香是活血伸筋的要药，抽经脚痉挛绷的很紧，我们会用到乳香。那过去呢要房间香一点你烧点乳香房间里面变得很香，这个它主要是通行周身经络，能够去风散瘀，活血定痛，托疮毒。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122170150-4y8382r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170150-4y8382r","updated":"20240204163630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以你看诸位现在学到了，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"金铃子，我们的延胡索我们的乳香我们的没药干嘛，止痛"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，有的时候癌症的痛的时候没有办法我们加重入药可以止痛效果绝对会比使用吗啡来的好，吗啡的后遗症很大，那我们中药有一些止痛药，那它能够止痛的原因呢就是因为它活血，所以痛是不通则痛，抽筋像那个我们中医只管症状抽筋，里面的原因可能是脑瘤或者是脑受伤产生的抽筋，我们都可以使用这个，那【之才】呢睡觉睡不好啊，还可以补肾有没有啊，能够安定各经络的痛都可以用乳香，所以乳香各位把它简单讲就是活血化瘀止痛药我们会用到乳香，像抽筋镇惊的药，我们休息一下。"}]},{"ID":"20240122170151-khcndt5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122170151-khcndt5","updated":"20240204163715"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"诸位看这就是左手就是豆鼓你们平常吃的，这就是那个没药，没药豆鼓可以打开来闻闻看，那这个乳香跟没药诸位可以使用，剂量上面来说的话我们平常开的剂量，比如说乳香两钱，没药两钱，那如果痛的很厉害三钱四钱都可以用没关系，必要的时候尽量用没有关系，那这个乳香长的就是这个样子，乳香都是树的脂，这乳香诸位可以打开来闻闻看。"}]}]}